  "definition": "Population residing in DEGURBA urban centres at mid-year. Cities use population, density and contiguity criteria (at least 1,500 inhabitants/km² and 50,000 inhabitants). This is not a municipal administrative population; constant geographic footprints across years are not established by the retained metadata.",
